@HostAddress = http://localhost:5168

### 1. Get All Categories (with product counts)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Category By ID with Simple Products
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create New Category
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Peripherals & Accessories",
  "description": "Cables, keyboards, mice, and desk accessories"
}

### 4. Get All Products (Full Overview)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Product Details By ID (Complex Query 1)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Low Stock Alerts (Complex Query 2)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/low-stock
Accept: application/json

### 7. Create New Product
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB",
  "sku": "KB-RGB-01",
  "description": "Tenkeyless mechanical gaming and office keyboard",
  "price": 89.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 8. Get All Warehouses (with stock metrics)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/warehouses
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Warehouse Details
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/warehouses/1
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get All Suppliers
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Supplier Details (with supplied products & prices)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/1
Accept: application/json
